  "description": "Official SDK for consuming TAF.CRUD microservice. Provides both synchronous (MediatR) and asynchronous (RabbitMQ) CRUD operations with fluent query builder API. v4.0.0: BREAKING - SDK routes aligned with API (uses centralized ApiRoutes from SharedKernel). Routes changed from /api/command/* to /api/v1/records/*. v3.0.1: Updated TAF.Infra.Contract to v1.9.0 (centralized OperationResult pattern from TAF.Infra). v3.0.0: BREAKING - Query() renamed to Entity(). Added stored query execution (Query/QueryById), server-side pagination (Skip/Take), and Parameters() for LINQ-style fluent API.",
